{'symbol': 'ABBV', 'date': '2023-04-12 11:00:00', 'title': 'ABBVIE INVITES COLLEGE STUDENTS LIVING WITH CYSTIC FIBROSIS TO APPLY FOR THE ABBVIE CF SCHOLARSHIP FOR THE 2023-2024 ACADEMIC SCHOOL YEAR', 'text': 'NORTH CHICAGO, ILL. , APRIL 12, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- ABBVIE TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT\xa0THE ABBVIE CYSTIC FIBROSIS (CF) SCHOLARSHIP, A\xa0PROGRAM THAT IS MAKING A DIFFERENCE IN THE LIVES OF YOUNG ADULTS WITH CF AND THEIR FAMILIES, IS NOW ACCEPTING APPLICATIONS FOR THE 2023-2024 ACADEMIC SCHOOL YEAR.'}